  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "en",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Dining & Restaurants In Rosetta {Rasheed}"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "mfpsbh4hqgfi",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In Rosetta, or Rasheed as it’s affectionately known, the culinary landscape presents a unique experience, distinct from the more tourist-centric dining options found in nearby cities like "
            },
            {
              "_key": "g7b0r6uqvji5",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "n0cdss0x3srp"
              ],
              "text": "Alexandria"
            },
            {
              "_key": "7ijvh7f1tyyx",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ". Here, the food scene is tailored more towards local tastes, offering a truly authentic Egyptian culinary journey."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "n0cdss0x3srp",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58750",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A Feast for the Senses on the Streets of Rosetta"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "As you wander through the historical Ottoman houses, the aroma of freshly grilled fish wafting through the streets is impossible to resist. These fish places, a staple in Rosetta, offer a rustic and genuine dining experience. The sight of fresh fish grilled right before your eyes, often served in simple, unpretentious settings, is a treat for those seeking authenticity. Though this might seem basic to some, the freshness of the fish ensures a delightful and safe culinary experience."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Abaza Restaurant: A Hidden Gem "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Nestled just a stone’s throw from the local museum, Abaza Restaurant is a hidden culinary treasure. This unassuming eatery, akin to a hole-in-the-wall, is renowned for its straightforward yet delicious kofta – minced meat and spices grilled on a skewer. Served in a cozy upstairs room adorned with a red carpet and a single table, this restaurant offers an intimate dining experience that echoes the town’s humble yet rich cultural tapestry."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Wadi Al Molouk Restaurant: A Barbecue Haven"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000012",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For those with a penchant for grilled delicacies, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000f"
              ],
              "text": "Wadi Al Molouk Restaurant"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " is a must-visit. Specializing in grilled meats and barbecue, this restaurant offers a hearty feast that caters to both local and visiting palates. Located in Al Seka Al Gadida, this restaurant stands as a testament to Rosetta’s love for grilled flavors, making it a popular choice among both residents and travel"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://www.facebook.com/wadyelmelouk2016/",
              "newTab": true
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/que-ver-en-rosetta.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "A photo depicting two boats on the shore of a waterway with an ornate building in the background, under a clear sky"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "The tranquil beauty of the Rosetta Riverbank, where ships dock and history stands tall"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000014",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Rosetta-Egypt.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "A white mosque with a golden minaret by the water's edge at sunset, with people gathered nearby"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Evening tranquility embraces the Suez waterfront as the day concludes in prayerful silence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000016",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Culinary Journey Through Egypt: A Taste of Tradition and Innovation"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000018",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Savor the flavors of Egypt on a culinary adventure that spans traditional dishes to contemporary cuisine. From aromatic street food in bustling markets to gourmet dining along the Nile, our guide invites you to feast on the rich tastes of Egypt. Click here to embark on your delicious journey!"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001a",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Learn more"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Cenas y Restaurantes En Rosetta {Rasheed}"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "utlad1oplsbt",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "En Rosetta, o Rasheed como se la conoce cariñosamente, el paisaje culinario presenta una experiencia única, distinta de las opciones gastronómicas más centradas en el turismo que se encuentran en ciudades cercanas como "
            },
            {
              "_key": "kk810doopqfr",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "g5r16i3l3pgn"
              ],
              "text": "Alejandría"
            },
            {
              "_key": "6fxfw3q5q7nd",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Aquí, la escena gastronómica se adapta más a los gustos locales, ofreciendo un viaje culinario egipcio verdaderamente auténtico. "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "g5r16i3l3pgn",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58750",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Una fiesta para los sentidos en las calles de Rosetta"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Mientras paseas por las históricas casas otomanas, es imposible resistirse al aroma del pescado recién asado que recorre las calles."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Estos locales de pescado, un elemento básico en Rosetta, ofrecen una experiencia gastronómica rústica y genuina."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Ver pescado fresco asado ante tus ojos, a menudo servido en "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000000d"
              ],
              "text": "lugares"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " sencillos y sin pretensiones, es un placer para los que buscan autenticidad."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Aunque a algunos les parezca básico, la frescura del pescado garantiza una experiencia culinaria deliciosa y "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000013",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000012"
              ],
              "text": "segura"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-rosetta-rasheed/lugares/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-rosetta-rasheed/lugares/",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/como-evitar-estafas-en-las-piramides-de-giza/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/como-evitar-estafas-en-las-piramides-de-giza",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000017",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Restaurante Abaza: Una joya escondida "
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000020",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Situado a tiro de piedra del museo local, el restaurante Abaza es un tesoro culinario oculto."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Este modesto restaurante, parecido a un agujero en la pared, es famoso por su sencilla pero deliciosa kofta, carne picada y especias asadas en una brocheta."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Servido en una acogedora sala en el piso de arriba, adornada "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001d"
              ],
              "text": "con una alfombra roja y una sola"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " mesa, este restaurante ofrece una experiencia gastronómica íntima que se hace eco del humilde pero rico tapiz cultural de la ciudad."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/el-tiempo-en-egipto/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/rosetta-rasheed/el-tiempo-en-rosetta-rashid-y-la-mejor-epoca-para-visitarla",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000022",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Restaurante Wadi Al Molouk: Un refugio para la barbacoa"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h3"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000031",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Para los amantes de los manjares a la parrilla, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000024"
              ],
              "text": "el restaurante Wadi Al Molouk"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " es una visita obligada."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Especializado en carnes a la parrilla y barbacoa, este restaurante ofrece un abundante festín "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000029"
              ],
              "text": "que satisface tanto a los paladares locales"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " como a los visitantes."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Situado en Al Seka Al "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000002e"
              ],
              "text": "Gadida"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000030",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": ", este restaurante es un testimonio del amor de Rosetta por los sabores a la parrilla, lo que lo convierte en una elección popular tanto entre los residentes como entre los viajeros."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
